{"id":"storona","lemma":"сторона","pos":"noun","rank":1707,"glosses":["side, hand, party","direction, quarter","place, region, country"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2c/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"стороны","plural":"стороны"},"examples":[{"text":"Что с другой стороны стены?","en":"What's on the other side of the wall?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"other"},null,null]},{"text":"Это была ошибка с моей стороны.","en":"That was an error on my part.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"mistake, error, fault"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Ты можешь открыть дверь со своей стороны?","en":"Can you open the door from your side?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to open"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Это не сильная моя сторона.","en":"That's not my strong suit.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"strong, powerful","l":"сильный"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Звук пришёл с той стороны.","en":"The sound came from that direction.","words":[{"g":"sound"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null]}]}